<ul><br/>
 	<li><strong><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/incredibooth-photo-booth/id6799999961">IncrediBooth</a></strong> (Free) - IncrediBooth turns the &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; into a little photo booth. Press the red button to capture an image, and your photo strip appears on the outer display. It's free to download, with five strips available per day.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/vntg-vintage-film-camera/id1113395996">VNTG</a></strong> (Free) - VNTG is an instant camera app where you close the &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; to take a shot and then open it up to develop it. It's free to download, with in-app purchases to unlock camera lenses.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/flipcorder-retro-camcorder/id6818168418">Flipcorder</a></strong> (&#36;4.99) - Flipcorder is a video recording app that turns the &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; into a retro camcorder. It's designed to be used for daily video diaries, and each tape is displayed on a shelf in the app. To film, just unfold the Duo. Recordings have classic VHS-style effects.</li><br/>
