<h2>Less Fun, More Serious</h2><br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/11/widen-app-iphone-duo.jpg" alt="" width="1931" height="1086" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1076241" /><br/>
<ul><br/>
 	<li><strong><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/widen/id6824905949">Widen</a></strong> (&#36;3.99) - Widen is another extension that expands Safari to take up the width of the outer display. It also hides cookie banners and works in Split View. There are multiple settings, so you can set just pictures to take up the full screen, or opt to have pictures and text expand.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/span-time-tracker-timesheet/id6787664361">SPAN</a></strong> (Free) - SPAN is an app that turns the &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; into a project tracker and timer. It has different views for each &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; orientation. SPAN is free to use for the current week, with a &#36;4.99/month pro subscription available for unlimited projects and full monthly and yearly reports.</li><br/>
 	<li><strong><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/braindrain-brain-dump-journal/id6741376368">BrainDrain</a></strong> (Free) - BrainDrain is a 60-second brain dump app that helps you sort your thoughts. On the &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj;, different Duo orientations have different purposes. You can use it like a laptop in a half fold, type thoughts with the Duo closed, or put it in tent mode to use voice capture.</li><br/>
</ul><br/>
